Maa Keh Rahi Thi Rokar Aye Jhule Wale Asghar<br>
bekal Hai Teri Maadar Aye Jhule Wale Asghar<br>
<br>
1. Tashnalabi Pe Teri Qurban Jaun Mai Bhi<br>
che Maah Ke Ghazamfar Aye Jhule Wale Asghar<br>
<br>
2. Sukhe Labo Pe Tune Sukhi Zaban Jo Pheri<br>
rone Lage Sitamgar Aye Jhule Wale Asghar<br>
<br>
3. Tere Gale Pe Beta Mara Shakhi Ne Paika<br>
hai Khoon Me Gala Tar Aye Jhule Wale Asghar<br>
<br>
4. Godi Ujad Gai Hai Ab Khaak Zindagi Hai<br>
barbad Hogaya Ghar Aye Jhule Wale Asghar<br>
<br>
5. Naize Me Laash Teri Pinha Lahad Se Nikli<br>
dil Phat Gaya Hai Dilbar Aye Jhule Wale Asghar<br>
<br>
6. Nanha Sa Ek Tan Hai Aur Wo Bhi Be Kafan Hai<br>
laasha Pada Hai Besar Aye Jhule Wale Asghar<br>
<br>
7. Naize Pe Sar Tera Hai Jhula Bhi Jal Raha Hai<br>
kia Karb Ka Hai Manzar Aye Jhule Wale Asghar<br>
<br>
8. Mai Kia Bataun Usko Tu Hee Batade Mujhko<br>
puche Jo Teri Qaahar Aye Jhule Wale Asghar<br>
<br>
9.khou Gashta Pairahan Ye Andisha Hai Fasi Ab<br>
barpa Karega Mehshar Aye Jhule Wale Asghar<br>
<br>
